    "Run on the S&P 500 at one XSP contract (139% of a $55,000 sleeve), the overlay changed the 2018-2026 Sharpe from 0.75 to 0.69, volatility from 16.2% to 12.0% and the worst drawdown from -24% to -17%, after costs.",
